  "title": "HB 2437 (2011-2012 Regular Session (2012)): Relating to voting; proof of United States citizenship. (as printed in index); AN ACT concerning elections; relating to voting; changing effective date of United States citizenship requirements; amending K.S.A. 2011 Supp. 25-2309 and repealing the existing section. (as introduced)",
  "urls": [
    "https://www.kslegislature.gov/li_2012/b2011_12/measures/hb2437/",
    "https://www.kslegislature.gov/li_2012/b2011_12/measures/documents/hb2437_01_0000.pdf",
